Proposal pending coordinator/NGD review. The Firefox/Mozilla attribution is not dropped.
Write-up and quotes: evidence/round4d/PROPOSED-ABOUT-WORDING.md, against the live Mozilla
Trademark Guidelines, Distribution Policy, and Trademarks List (fetched 2026-11-10).

Dane About text (dane-community-2 / dane-community-exp in greatdane brand.ftl, used by
aboutDialog.xhtml when MOZ_OFFICIAL_BRANDING is not set):

  Dane is built from Mozilla's open source Firefox ESR web browser. Dane is not
  officially associated with Mozilla or its products. Mozilla is a global community...

trademarkInfo, previously blank, is now: "Firefox and Mozilla are trademarks of
Mozilla.org in the U.S. and other countries."

Unique Fluent IDs in the branding file (shipped for every locale by locales/jar.mn)
avoid depending on Fluent first-wins vs last-wins. en-US aboutDialog.ftl is kept in
sync; official branding still uses community-2 / community-exp. No logos are added.
Internal names, greatdane.* prefs, and the bundle ID are unchanged.

Prepared only. Not built, signed, notarized or published.
